  "html": "\n<div align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"745\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\" height=\"256\" rowspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"115\"><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><a href=\"/site/skill/uo_knowhow/\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"90\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/l_logo_rare_t.gif\" width=\"110\"></a></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><a href=\"/site/skill/uo_knowhow_rare/\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/l_logo_rare_1.gif\" width=\"110\"></a></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><a href=\"/site/skill/uo_knowhow_rare_1/\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/rare/l_logo_rare_3.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:110/20\" width=\"110\"></a></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><a href=\"/site/skill/uo_knowhow_rare_2/\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/l_logo_rare_2.gif\" width=\"110\"></a></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><a href=\"/site/skill/uo_knowhow_rare_3/\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/l_logo_rare_5.gif\" width=\"110\"></a></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><a href=\"/site/skill/uo_knowhow_rare_4/\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/l_logo_rare_4.gif\" width=\"110\"></a></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><a href=\"/site/skill/uo_knowhow_rare_5/\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/l_logo_rare_6.gif\" width=\"110\"></a></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"5\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/l_logo_rare_b.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></p>\n</td>\n<td height=\"10\" width=\"627\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"20\" width=\"627\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>&nbsp;Semi Rare</b></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"39\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"28\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/rare_1.gif\" width=\"170\"></font>\n</p><table border=\"\" bordercolordark=\"#999999\" bordercolorlight=\"#999999\" width=\"504\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" height=\"14\" width=\"494\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"blue\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>세미레어</b></font><font color=\"#636363\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">[몇십분마다 \n                        리스폰]</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"95\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">그림</font></p></td>\n<td width=\"165\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">이름</font></p></td>\n<td width=\"184\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">설명</font></p></td>\n<td width=\"32\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">사진</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"95\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"19\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/copperwire.gif\" width=\"23\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"18\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/goldwire.gif\" width=\"22\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"19\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/silverwire.gif\" width=\"23\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"18\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/ironwire.gif\" width=\"22\"></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"28\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/horseshoes.gif\" width=\"21\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/forgedmetal.gif\" width=\"20\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"24\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/ingots.gif\" width=\"22\"></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"165\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Wire,Horse shoes</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Forged metal,Ingots</font></p></td>\n<td width=\"184\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">셔펜트홀에서 주로 리젠</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">그외 부케와 </font>\n</p><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">스카라브레이스에서도리젠</font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"32\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20010803115721/http://forg.co.kr/skill/images/rare/r11.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b><img border=\"0\" height=\"18\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/dd.gif\" width=\"13\"></b></font></a></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"95\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"25\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/whip.gif\" width=\"19\"></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"165\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Whip</font></p></td>\n<td width=\"184\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">스카라에 잇는 레인저 </font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">헛간 4군데</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">길따라 가다보시면 </font>\n</p><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">2군데가 더 있습니다</font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"32\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20010803115721/http://forg.co.kr/skill/images/rare/r12.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b><img border=\"0\" height=\"18\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/dd.gif\" width=\"13\"></b></font></a></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"95\"><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"40\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/dflowers2.gif\" width=\"13\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"41\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/dflower.gif\" width=\"15\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"36\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/donions.gif\" width=\"12\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"34\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/dherbs.gif\" width=\"11\"></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"165\"><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Dried Flowers</font></p></td>\n<td width=\"184\"><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">문글로우 은행 바로 북서쪽에서 \n                        리젠</font></p></td>\n<td width=\"32\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20010803115721/http://forg.co.kr/skill/images/rare/sr1.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b><img border=\"0\" height=\"18\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/dd.gif\" width=\"13\"></b></font></a></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"95\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"19\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/baconslab.gif\" width=\"27\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"17\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/coconutsplit.gif\" width=\"27\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"22\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/bananas.gif\" width=\"24\"></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"10\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/cheesewedge.gif\" width=\"13\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/pumpkin.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/lemons.gif\" width=\"21\"></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"165\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Bacon,Coconut,Banana</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Cheese,Large Pumpkin</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Limes&amp;Lemons</font></p></td>\n<td width=\"184\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">각마을 \n                        잡화점에서도 리젠</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">호박은 큰 것이 세미레어임</font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"32\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">-</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"95\"><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"19\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/rollingpin.gif\" width=\"19\"></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"165\"><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Rollingpin</font></p></td>\n<td width=\"184\"><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">베스퍼&amp;Yew 빵집에서 리젠 </font>\n</p><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">\n                        각마을 빵집에서 리젠</font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"32\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20010803115721/http://forg.co.kr/skill/images/rare/sr2.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b><img border=\"0\" height=\"18\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/dd.gif\" width=\"13\"></b></font></a></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"95\"><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"24\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/paints.gif\" width=\"18\"></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"165\"><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">PaintBrush</font></p></td>\n<td width=\"184\"><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">베스퍼 화랑에서 리젠 </font>\n</p><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Ocello에서도 \n                        리젠</font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"32\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20010803115721/http://forg.co.kr/skill/images/rare/sr3.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b><img border=\"0\" height=\"18\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/dd.gif\" width=\"13\"></b></font></a></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"95\"><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"28\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/toolkit2.gif\" width=\"28\"></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"165\"><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">ToolKit</font></p></td>\n<td width=\"184\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">파푸아 도구점</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">각마을 상자있는 팅거샾</font></p></td>\n<td width=\"32\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20010803115721/http://forg.co.kr/skill/images/rare/sr4.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b><img border=\"0\" height=\"18\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/dd.gif\" width=\"13\"></b></font></a></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"95\"><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"22\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/arrow.gif\" width=\"14\"></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"165\"><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Arrows</font></p></td>\n<td width=\"184\"><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">파푸아,베스터팅거샾</font></p></td>\n<td width=\"32\"><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">-</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"95\"><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"13\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/dates.gif\" width=\"15\"></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"165\"><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Dates</font></p></td>\n<td width=\"184\"><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">각마을 잡화점</font><font color=\"red\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>*</b></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"32\"><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">-</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"95\"><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"14\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/deadwood.gif\" width=\"10\"></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"165\"><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Dead Wood</font></p></td>\n<td width=\"184\"><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">리퍼를 룻하면 나온다</font><font color=\"red\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>*</b></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"32\"><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">-</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"95\"><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/fertile.gif\" width=\"15\"></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"165\"><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Fertile Dirt</font></p></td>\n<td width=\"184\"><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">어스를 룻하면 나온다</font><font color=\"red\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>*</b></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"32\"><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">-</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"95\"><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/bone.gif\" width=\"21\"></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"165\"><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Bone</font></p></td>\n<td width=\"184\"><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">본메이지를 룻하면나온다</font><font color=\"red\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>*</b></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"32\"><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">-</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"95\"><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"12\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/blackmore.gif\" width=\"11\"></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"165\"><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Blackmoor</font></p></td>\n<td width=\"184\"><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">리치로드를 룻하면 나온다</font><font color=\"red\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>*</b></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"32\"><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">-</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"95\"><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"17\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/chisels.gif\" width=\"15\"></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"165\"><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">chisels</font></p></td>\n<td width=\"184\"><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">카펜상점상자에서 리젠</font><font color=\"red\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>*</b></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"32\"><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">-</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"95\"><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/rare/head.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:22/16\" width=\"22\"></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"165\"><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Head</font></p></td>\n<td width=\"184\"><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">좀비를 룻하면 나온다</font><font color=\"red\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>*</b></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"32\"><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">-</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"95\"><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"21\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/rare/vialblood.gif\" width=\"10\"></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"165\"><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">vial of blood</font></p></td>\n<td width=\"184\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">블러드 엘리멘탈을 </font>\n</p><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">룻하면 나온다</font><font color=\"red\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>*</b></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"32\"><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">-</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<ul>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"red\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>p.s</b></font><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"> : 세미레어는 약간의 스틸링과 락픽이 필요합니다.</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">마법 \n            언락으로 열수도 있습니다</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">스틸링은 주변 타일에 의해 엔피씨에게 걸리지 \n            않을 확률을 높여줍니다.</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">엔피씨를 \"Vendor move\"를 해서 \n            스틸할 아템에서 멀리 떨어지게 하시던지</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"> \"벤더이름 What town \n            is this\"처럼 말을 시키시면서 훔치시면됩니다, </font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">작업을 하실 때는  \n            부활하실수있는 파트너와 함께 하시면 더 편합니다.</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">전문 세미레어 벤더샾으로 돈을 예상외로 마니 \n            버실수있습니다...</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#636363\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">상자속에 잡스러운 물건도 \n            함께 스틸해서 버리셔야 리젠이 잘된다는 것을 참고하시길..</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">세미레어 헌터분들끼리 사이좋게 나눠가지시길 \n            당부바랍니다-\"-</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"red\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">*표시는 쓰레기취급을 받는 \n            아이템</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"red\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"gray\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>Written By Forg</b></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"red\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>&nbsp;</b></font></p>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"20\" width=\"627\"><p align=\"right\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;<a href=\"/site/skill/uo_knowhow_rare/\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/top.gif\" width=\"50\"></a></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n",
